=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to Nbu Latteh on Gold Street to start quest.
** She will give you a Fire Crystal you can use to craft your {i:Copper Ring|Copper Ring|13454} if you choose.
* **(Optional)** speak to {n:Nbu Latteh} again, as well as the guard {p:Parnika} to the south, for hints at Nbu's occupation.
* Obtain a {i:Copper Ring|Copper Ring|13454} either via {z:Auction House}, {p:Merchants|Category:Shopkeepers} or {p:Crafting|Category:Craft}.
* Trade Copper Ring to {n:Roh Latteh} in Bastok Mines (H-7), she is located on the first floor house on Ore Street.
* Upon NPC dialogue completion, you will obtain {@k} {k:Letter from Roh Latteh}.
* If you 'check' the letter (as in read it from your Key Item menu) you will receive a penalty and get only half the actual reward.
* Return to Nbu Latteh to complete quest.
* This quest is repeatable for players below Bastok fame level 2. Zone out each time and you can re-do it.

